,"user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2014-05-04T15:40:32Z","updated_at":"2014-05-04T15:40:32Z","body":"Erm, yes that code seems wrong. I have fixed the parameter inversion. \n\nThe glm::log function returns a quaternion that is quite a NaN for the quaternion I think which explain the glm::exp behavior on that result.\n\nThis said log(0) is -inf so the result you see might actually make sense here.\n","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/g-truc/glm/issues/comments/42135894/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"event":"commented","actor":{"login":"Groovounet","id":367227,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM2NzIyNw==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/367227?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Groovounet","html_url":"https://github.com/Groovounet","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Groovounet/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Groovounet/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Groovounet/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Groovounet/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Groovounet/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Groovounet/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Groovounet/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Groovounet/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Groovounet/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false}},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/g-truc/glm/issues/comments/42136384","html_url":"https://github.com/g-truc/glm/issues/199#issuecomment-42136384","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/g-truc/glm/issues/199","id":42136384,"node_id":"MDEyOklzc3VlQ29tbWVudDQyMTM2Mzg0","user":{"login":"kschoice","id":7459103,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc0NTkxMDM=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/7459103?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/kschoice","html_url":"https://github.com/kschoice","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kschoice/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kschoice/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kschoice/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kschoice/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kschoice/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kschoice/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kschoice/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kschoice/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kschoice/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2014-05-04T15:57:45Z","updated_at":"2014-05-04T15:58:11Z","body":"Thanks for taking in account the bug described in my first message.\n\n\"This said log(0) is -inf so the result you see might actually make sense here.\"\n\nSorry, but I think you misunderstood the problem in my second message. The exp function is the one producing NaNs :\nglm::quat q; // q (1, 0, 0, 0)\nglm::quat p = glm::log(q); // After this, p = (0, 0, 0, 0), which is fine (log (1 + 0_i + 0_j + 0*k) = log(1) = 0)\nqlm::quat r = glm::exp(p); // After this, r = (NaN, NaN, NaN, NaN) and should be (1, 0, 0, 0)\nThe problem is glm::exp makes a division by the norm of vec3(r.x, r.y, r.z). This happens for any quaternion argument with no imaginary part (e.g., equivalent to a plain number).\n","author_association":"NONE","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/g-truc/glm/issues/comments/42136384/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"event":"commented","actor":{"login":"kschoice","id":7459103,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc0NTkxMDM=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/7459103?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/kschoice","html_url":"https://github.com/kschoice","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kschoice/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kschoice/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kschoice/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kschoice/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kschoice/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kschoice/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kschoice/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kschoice/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kschoice/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false}},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/g-truc/glm/issues/comments/42137563","html_url":"https://github.com/g-truc/glm/issues/199#issuecomment-42137563","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/g-truc/glm/issues/199","id":42137563,"node_id":"MDEyOklzc3VlQ29tbWVudDQyMTM3NTYz","user":{"login":"Groovounet","id":367227,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM2NzIyNw==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/367227?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Groovounet","html_url":"https://github.com/Groovounet","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Groovounet/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Groovounet/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Groovounet/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Groovounet/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Groovounet/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Groovounet/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Groovounet/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Groovounet/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Groovounet/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2014-05-04T16:46:01Z","updated_at":"2014-05-04T16:46:01Z","body":"Erm true. I understood correctly your explanation but my analysis was too quick.  \n","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/g-truc/glm/issues/comments/42137563/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"event":"commented","actor":{"login":"Groovounet","id":367227,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM2NzIyNw==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/367227?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Groovounet","html_url":"https://github.com/Groovounet","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Groovounet/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Groovounet/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Groovounet/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Groovounet/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Groovounet/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Groovounet/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Groovounet/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Groovounet/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Groovounet/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false}},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/g-truc/glm/issues/comments/42137617","html_url":"https://github.com/g-truc/glm/issues/199#issuecomment-42137617","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/g-truc/glm/issues/199","id":42137617,"node_id":"MDEyOklzc3VlQ29tbWVudDQyMTM3NjE3","user":{"login":"kschoice","id":7459103,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc0NTkxMDM=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/7459103?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/kschoice","html_url":"https://github.com/kschoice","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kschoice/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kschoice/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kschoice/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kschoice/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kschoice/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kschoice/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kschoice/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kschoice/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kschoice/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2014-05-04T16:47:49Z","updated_at":"2014-05-04T16:47:49Z","body":"Good. I hope this can benefit others, though I'm guessing not much people use log and exp for quaternions.\n","author_association":"NONE","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/g-truc/glm/issues/comments/42137617/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"event":"commented","actor":{"login":"kschoice","id":7459103,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc0NTkxMDM=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/7459103?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/kschoice","html_url":"https://github.com/kschoice","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kschoice/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kschoice/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kschoice/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kschoice/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kschoice/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kschoice/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kschoice/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kschoice/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kschoice/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false}},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/g-truc/glm/issues/comments/46557307","html_url":"https://github.com/g-truc/glm/issues/199#issuecomment-46557307","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/g-truc/glm/issues/199","id":46557307,"node_id":"MDEyOklzc3VlQ29tbWVudDQ2NTU3MzA3","user":{"login":"kschoice","id":7459103,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc0NTkxMDM=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/7459103?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/kschoice","html_url":"https://github.com/kschoice","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kschoice/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kschoice/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kschoice/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kschoice/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kschoice/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kschoice/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kschoice/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kschoice/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kschoice/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2014-06-19T13:06:00Z","updated_at":"2014-06-19T13:06:00Z","body":"Another problem with quaternion log :\nif((q.x == T(0)) && (q.y == T(0)) && (q.z == T(0)))\n{\n...\n}\nelse\n{\n    T Vec3Len = sqrt(q.x \\* q.x + q.y \\* q.y + q.z \\* q.z);\n    T QuatLen = sqrt(Vec3Len \\* Vec3Len + q.w \\* q.w);\n    T t = atan(Vec3Len, T(q.w)) / Vec3Len;\n}\n\nProblem is (it just happened to me with Visual Studio 2012), Vec3Len can compute to a strict 0, even if q.x, q.y and q.z aren't all strict 0s. Thus raising division by zero.\n\nI fixed it this way (I realize it may be a waste to compute Vec3Len in all cases, but I am more concerned with consistency) :\nT Vec3Len = sqrt(q.x \\* q.x + q.y \\* q.y + q.z \\* q.z);\nif (abs(Vec3Len) < std::numeric_limits<T>::epsilon())\n{\n...\n}\nelse\n{\n    T QuatLen = sqrt(Vec3Len \\* Vec3Len + q.w \\* q.w);\n    T t = atan(Vec3Len, T(q.w)) / Vec3Len;\n}\n\nPlease let me know if you think I disregarded something.\n","author_association":"NONE","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/g-truc/glm/issues/comments/46557307/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"event":"commented","actor":{"login":"kschoice","id":7459103,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc0NTkxMDM=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/7459103?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/kschoice","html_url":"https://github.com/kschoice","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kschoice/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kschoice/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kschoice/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kschoice/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kschoice/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kschoice/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kschoice/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kschoice/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kschoice/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false}},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/g-truc/glm/issues/comments/46655111","html_url":"https://github.com/g-truc/glm/issues/199#issuecomment-46655111","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/g-truc/glm/issues/199","id":46655111,"node_id":"MDEyOklzc3VlQ29tbWVudDQ2NjU1MTEx","user":{"login":"Nemikolh","id":4008156,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQwMDgxNTY=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4008156?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nemikolh","html_url